NOTE! This folder doesn't contain anyfile for METHANOL because it was done in one of other tutorials. 

You can find here files for the following alcohols: ETHANOL, PROPANOL, BUTANOL, PENTANOL, HEXANOL, HEPTANOL, OCTANOL, PHENOL.

These files are the corresponding ones for earlier uplodaded structures. All structures were, of course, optimised. 

The assigned force field was OPLSAA-FF.

Every file contains following descriptions for each molecule of an alcohol:
- Partial atomic charges & coordinates
- Bonds
- Angles
- Dihedrals 
- Dispersions
